", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JanusImageUnderstanding"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [10], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING"}], "size": [315, 344.27008056640625], "pos": [-2559.547842751643, 2708.8402232394874], "widgets_values": ["", "这张图像展示了一位坐在咖啡馆内的年轻女性。她穿着黑色短袖上衣和白色高腰短裙，显得时尚且优雅。她坐在一张木质桌子旁，桌子上摆放着几样食物和饮品，包括一杯咖啡、一盘水果沙拉和一瓶饮料。\n\n背景中可以看到窗外的街道，街道两旁有绿树和一些商店，商店的招牌上写有“LIZIANG”等字样。街道上停着一辆银色汽车，整体环境显得非常清新和舒适。\n\n图像风格为自然、清新，光线柔和，给人一种放松和愉悦的感觉。整体色调温暖，主体人物的微笑和姿态也增添了图像的亲切感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 25, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [5], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING"}], "size": [315.7864685058594, 341.91070556640625], "pos": [-2229.547842751643, 2708.8402232394874], "widgets_values": ["", "This image shows a young woman sitting in a café. She was wearing a black sleeve shirt and a white high waist skirt, which appeared to be fashionable and elegant. She was sitting at a wooden table with several foods and drinks, including a coffee, a fruit salad and a bottle of drinks.\n\nThe street outside the window can be seen in the background, with green trees and shops on either side of the street, whose sign says “Liziang”. A silver car was parked on the street and the overall environment was very fresh and comfortable.\n\nImage styles are nature, freshness and light, giving people a sense of relief and pleasure. The overall tone is warm, and the smiles and gestures of the main figure add to the image ' s affection."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": {"0": 302.